    {
      "id": "claim_d69c134463eb4f8f9c0946931f5bc75b",
      "statement": "Kept statement text has existing [doc_N] markers stripped and replaced with sorted, deduplicated valid doc_N markers appended at the end (format_statement); only the literal linebreak values \\n, \\n\\n, and \\n\\n\\n are converted to real newlines, and any other/unexpected value is treated as no linebreak with a logged warning (convert_linebreaks).",
