    },
    {
      "id": "claim_34d36a8af20b447abe7781f2ed6d857b",
      "statement": "FALLBACK_MESSAGE is the exact string \"I'm sorry, I couldn't validate the information to answer your question.\" and is returned verbatim whenever join_statements receives no surviving statements, whenever validate_citations_and_build_answer receives a structured answer with no statements, and directly from structure_and_validate_async on the scaffold-defense and marker-mismatch paths; this string is truthy, so the turn completes normally and renders it as the answer rather than being treated as an error.",
