      "id": "claim_2cd9042d01764cf59c9eca6243d359b3",
      "statement": "Missing required inputs (plain_answer, retrieval_results, formatted_docs, or prompt_id_map) or a failed/unparseable structuring LLM call return (None, None) from structure_and_validate_async rather than FALLBACK_MESSAGE, and the graph node validate_answer wraps the whole call so any exception is also converted to (structured=None, validated=None); validation must never fail open.",
