      "id": "claim_bbfade2565f64fc9a338688d22214dfc",
      "statement": "The validate_answer graph node scrubs PHI from every kept structured statement's text field and every citation's doc_id/source_name/quote fields via scrub_phi before they land in graph state, and separately scrubs the final validated answer string; with HC_RAG_DISABLE_STAGES=validate the node instead passes through the unvalidated but still PHI-scrubbed plain answer, which is ablation-only behavior not intended for production.",
      "evidence": [
