      "statement": "This citation-validation and fuzzy-matching behavior is covered by tests/test_answer_validation.py (valid/invalid quote thresholds, mixed valid/invalid citations, uncited statements, duplicate/misordered citation canonicalization, unknown/malformed citation IDs, marker-mismatch fail-closed) and tests/test_validation_scaffold_prefix.py (scaffold-prefix fail-closed variants and a benign-prose false-positive-avoidance case), exercised without any live LLM call via an injected llm_call callable.",
